 been commentary on the international front, just wondering if you had any early insights from the adoption of GDPR and any impact on inbound interest or business in the European theaters.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/09/dropbox-inc-dbx-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2018 Q2","e":"dbx","d":"2018-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"Using SMR technology will increase overall storage density from 8 terabytes to 15 terabytes per disk and provide continued cost savings without sacrificing performance or reliability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/09/dropbox-inc-dbx-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2018 Q2","e":"dbx","d":"2018-08-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Dennis Woodside","x":"At this scale, we have a tremendous opportunity to help streamline end-to-end workflows and serve as a unified home for team content and collaboration.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/09/dropbox-inc-dbx-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2018 Q4","e":"dbx","d":"2019-02-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Richard Davis","x":"We're not like running out of runway there in terms of cost savings, right?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/21/dropbox-inc-dbx-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-t.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2019 Q1","e":"dbx","d":"2019-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Houston","x":"In Q1, we launched Bulk Member Imports to streamline identity management and provisioning for teams.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/09/dropbox-inc-dbx-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2019 Q1","e":"dbx","d":"2019-05-09","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Houston","x":"In more complex workflows, users can even streamline hiring and onboarding by connecting a new employees resume in greenhouse to their signed contract in Dropbox and subsequently merge that content with the new higher record in Workday.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/09/dropbox-inc-dbx-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2019 Q2","e":"dbx","d":"2019-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Daniel Church","x":"With respect to the price increase in May, can you give us some color on how churn has been relative to your expectations?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/09/dropbox-inc-dbx-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2019 Q2","e":"dbx","d":"2019-08-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Daniel Church","x":"And then lastly, how do you think about your ability to raise prices over time?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/09/dropbox-inc-dbx-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2019 Q3","e":"dbx","d":"2019-11-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Charlie Rogers","x":"Could you provide a little bit more color on the mix shift of annual versus monthly customers, given the price increases?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/dropbox-inc-dbx-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2019 Q3","e":"dbx","d":"2019-11-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Alex Zukin","x":"And then you guys, I think you mentioned a couple of items where you were able to raise prices, you're very happy with the dynamics around both user adds and revenue retention and you made a comment around, you could see some, maybe impact to user adds over the next few quarters, but also a…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/dropbox-inc-dbx-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2019 Q3","e":"dbx","d":"2019-11-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"New capabilities like these are helping our user streamline their workflows and stay in sync with their customers, partners and teams.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/07/dropbox-inc-dbx-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2019 Q4","e":"dbx","d":"2020-02-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"We plan to do this by simplifying the process of setting up a Dropbox business team and streamlining the invitation process to reduce the friction of finding and adding new team members.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/21/dropbox-inc-dbx-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2020 Q1","e":"dbx","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"Customers to this SKU [Phonetic] can now streamline multi-team management with centralized visibility and delegation controls, providing oversight over documents, templates, branding and usage.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/dropbox-inc-dbx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2020 Q1","e":"dbx","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"Together, our new Dropbox Business insights dashboard and the advanced admin and security features we introduced for HelloSign help to streamline the admin experience as team scale their deployments of Dropbox.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/dropbox-inc-dbx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2020 Q1","e":"dbx","d":"2020-05-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ajay Vashee","x":"So, one given the resilience of the core business, to your point, we are largely maintaining our annual guidance, net of currency and interest rate movements introduced by COVID-19 and we are seeing some encouraging top of funnel trends.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/08/dropbox-inc-dbx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2020 Q2","e":"dbx","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"And other examples of streamlining and simplifying experiences are we want to help folks get into Dropbox Business teams.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/dropbox-inc-dbx-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2020 Q2","e":"dbx","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"And so we streamlined -- we've made a lot of progress with things like streamlining the invitation process and onboarding process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/07/dropbox-inc-dbx-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"DBX 2020 Q3","e":"dbx","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"Similarly, this quarter, we also partnered with Adobe to launch Dropbox Transfer for Adobe Creative Cloud, streamlining the way users deliver final projects.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/dropbox-inc-dbx-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2020 Q3","e":"dbx","d":"2020-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"We want to help streamline our users' most common workflows so that they can spend less time switching between apps and more time in getting important work done.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/06/dropbox-inc-dbx-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2020 Q4","e":"dbx","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"And finally, last month, we also announced an 11% reduction in force to streamline our teams against structure, strengthen our operational discipline and better align to our Virtual First strategy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/dropbox-inc-dbx-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2020 Q4","e":"dbx","d":"2021-02-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Regan","x":"This margin guidance excludes approximately $15 million related to the severance and benefits paid to employees impacted by a reduction in force in Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/18/dropbox-inc-dbx-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2021 Q1","e":"dbx","d":"2021-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Ben Rose","x":"I was just curious to know how you are thinking about the pricing of various different plans whether you are anticipating or contemplating any price increases for your user base over time?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/dropbox-inc-dbx-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2021 Q1","e":"dbx","d":"2021-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"One way we improved the user experience this quarter was streamlining our in-product promotions to ensure people can focus on our content and work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/dropbox-inc-dbx-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2021 Q1","e":"dbx","d":"2021-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"Collectively, by streamlining the total number of Dropbox promotions our users see, releasing Passwords to our basic users and continuing to invest in solutions like Transfer and Family plan, we're making great progress in evolving the core Dropbox experience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/07/dropbox-inc-dbx-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2021 Q2","e":"dbx","d":"2021-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jack Nichols","x":"How are you guys thinking about potential price increases in the environment across, I guess, the full product line?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/dropbox-inc-dbx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2021 Q2","e":"dbx","d":"2021-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Houston","x":"And for example, we raised prices on our Plus SKU in 2019 and 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/dropbox-inc-dbx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2021 Q2","e":"dbx","d":"2021-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Houston","x":"Overall, our team is innovating on a highly complex tech stack and their hard work is resulting in lower-energy consumption and tangible cost savings as demonstrated by our strong gross margins in Q2.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/dropbox-inc-dbx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2021 Q2","e":"dbx","d":"2021-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Timothy Regan","x":"…to note that unless otherwise indicated, all income statement measures mentioned are non-GAAP and exclude stock-based compensation, amortization of purchased intangibles, certain acquisition-related expenses, impairments of our real estate assets, and expenses related to our reduction in force.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/dropbox-inc-dbx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2021 Q3","e":"dbx","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"And we're excited to offer our customers a more complete and document workflow solution for streamlining transactions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/dropbox-inc-dbx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2021 Q3","e":"dbx","d":"2021-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tim Regan","x":"…to note that unless otherwise indicated, all income statement measures mentioned are non-GAAP and exclude stock-based compensation, amortization of purchased intangibles, certain acquisition-related expenses, impairments of our real estate assets and expenses related to our reduction in force.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/05/dropbox-inc-dbx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2021 Q4","e":"dbx","d":"2022-02-17","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kash Rangan","x":"And also what does this mean for the pricing power of the company and what we all know to be a very inflationary environment?","