ttps://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/dropbox-dbx-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2025 Q3","e":"dbx","d":"2025-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Timothy Regan","x":"We are also lowering our CapEx guidance to be in the range of $20 million to $25 million for the full year, and we are maintaining our outlook for additions to finance lease lines to be approximately 6% of revenue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/dropbox-dbx-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2026 Q1","e":"dbx","d":"2026-05-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Drew Houston","x":"To support this, we have built what we call our context engine, which is our proprietary AI infrastructure that gathers context across all your content and apps and connects it to leading AI models to enable faster, more accurate, and more useful results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/dropbox-dbx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2026 Q1","e":"dbx","d":"2026-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ross Tennenbaum","x":"The year-over-year increase in cash flow primarily reflects stronger operating performance and the absence of certain one-time cash outflows, including a $36 million payment for the buyout of our San Francisco lease and $10 million in payments related to our Q4 2024 reduction in force.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/dropbox-dbx-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2026 Q2","e":"dbx","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ashraf Alkarmi","x":"We're also seeing that the infrastructure behind Dropbox has become increasingly relevant in an AI-first world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/dropbox-dbx-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"DBX 2026 Q2","e":"dbx","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ashraf Alkarmi","x":"It's still early, but we believe Dropbox can play an increas